NAME
    gcloud apihub apis versions operations - manage Api Operation resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud apihub apis versions operations COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Api Operation resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create apiOperations.

     delete
        Delete apiOperations.

     describe
        Describe apiOperations.

     list
        List apiOperations.

     update
        Update apiOperations.

NOTES
    This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha apihub apis versions operations

